<p>In mid November I started working on a new project for Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting, a company specializing in custom holiday lights and decorations for homes, businesses, and HOA's/property managers.</p>
<p>With many people starting to decorate for the holiday season around Thanksgiving time, Steve at Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting needed his project completed timely. Being a seasonal business he is on a time constraint to take in all new work before the holidays in December, and some of his clients like to start before thanksgiving.</p>

