    <img src="<?php echo webstar_h($mdhlCaseStudyImg('mdhl-bloomfield-hills-4.webp')); ?>" alt="Bloomfield Hills home with professional holiday lighting" width="1280" height="854" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <img src="<?php echo webstar_h($mdhlCaseStudyImg('mdhl-ranch-estates-11.webp')); ?>" alt="Ranch estate with roofline lights, blue-wrapped tree, wreath on gable, and arched entry at night" width="1280" height="854" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<p>The goal for this site was to get people to call. Have the user see the options, then have them call for a quote. This means big pictures, light and airy site copy, and big call to action buttons.</p>

<h2>Photography Services</h2>
<p>As part of this project, the site needed high quality photos with composition and color correction in mind. The previous photos on the old site were washed out and too small to ingest even on desktop.</p>
<p>Webstar is located in the Metro Detroit area, so bringing photography services to several of Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting's client work was easy. Crisp nighttime photos were edited to not be too washed out with the bright lights. The new site photos are clean, sized to the site, and color corrected to make the lights as they appear to the human eye on the ground. Not too bright, not too fuzzy, and not too washed out.</p>

<h2>Business Profiles</h2>
<p>Part of establishing an online presence is having business profiles on all platforms that people (and artificial intelligence) use to determine authority of the business.</p>
<p>As part of elevating Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting's online presence, we made a Google Business Profile, a Yelp account, and an Apple Maps account.</p>

<h2>Deliverables</h2>
<p>As the final deliverables, Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting received a Business Website, complete with google business profile, analytics, and all deliverables included in the package, they also received photography services, and lastly, Webstar Hosting Care Plan.</p>
<p>These deliverables help establish an online presence for a business with more than 20 years of experience, and the ongoing care plan ensures that they will be covered for any maintenance, security, and changes that they would like each month.</p>

<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p>It was an honor to work with Steve at Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting to make a site and online presence fit for his company. I look forward to maintaining and working with Steve and Metro Detroit Holiday Lighting for the foreseeable future!</p>